[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18604.67, "timestamp": "05:10:04", "text": "眼睛啊，跟我们之前做的一样，呃，那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18608.75, "timestamp": "05:10:08", "text": "呃，那玩意儿叫什么来着？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18611.75, "timestamp": "05:10:11", "text": "你最想先做哪一个？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18613.788, "timestamp": "05:10:13", "text": "但我甚至不知道是哪些模块。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18617.19, "timestamp": "05:10:17", "text": "好了，你得告诉他们哦，走吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18620.788, "timestamp": "05:10:20", "text": "前面有个大按钮，涉及"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18623.59, "timestamp": "05:10:23", "text": "然后是“西蒙说”和文本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18626.99, "timestamp": "05:10:26", "text": "你知道的，就是那个文本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18629.788, "timestamp": "05:10:29", "text": "东西文本东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18633.39, "timestamp": "05:10:33", "text": "是的，关于“谁”这个话题，好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18636.27, "timestamp": "05:10:36", "text": "首先，标签上写了什么？标签上写了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18639.91, "timestamp": "05:10:39", "text": "好的好的好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18644.83, "timestamp": "05:10:44", "text": "好的，A Y 好的，那么是什么呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18648.99, "timestamp": "05:10:48", "text": "右上角的那个词是什么意思？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18651.47, "timestamp": "05:10:51", "text": "按钮显示“右”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18657.59, "timestamp": "05:10:57", "text": "好了，我要给你读一段……"}]